{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467000/extras/wishlist3.gif?t=1738711557\" />You will have to help the brave legendary beaver, who fearlessly overcomes all obstacles. Exciting adventures and clashes with various opponents are waiting for you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467000/extras/about2.gif?t=1738711557\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BOBR SPRINT This is an old-school platformer, with increasing levels of difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increasing difficulty is done by increasing the number of obstacles and enemies on the level, the appearance of dynamic platforms, obstacles and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467000/extras/Features.gif?t=1738711557\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467000/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1738711557\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight enemies, find secrets, run through levels that have an obstacle system lined up</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Old-school platformer is a game that incorporates elements of classic games from the 1980s and 1990s. This genre is characterized by simple character control, linear levels with hidden secrets and bosses, and classic pixel-art graphics. A feature of this genre is the high level of difficulty, requiring the player to react quickly and be precise in controlling the character.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100 coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2467000/666212603e35b6abfc741eebc2c205da8bfc834d.jpg"},{"name":"10 coins","path":"https://c